“(D) $16,635,616 for the period beginning on October 1, 2023, and ending on November 17, 2023, $21,834,247 for the period beginning on November 18, 2023, and ending on January 19, 2024, $16,982,192 for the period beginning on January 20, 2024, and ending on March 8, 2024, and 138 STAT. 1763
$164,136,986 for the period beginning on October 1, 2023, and ending on December 31, 2024; and
“(E) $43,150,685 for the period beginning on January 1, 2025, and ending on March 31, 2025.”
